  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Train the trainer. NL Study Visit for the Uganda Revenue Authority (March 2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A delegation of 6 Uganda Revenue Authority (URA) officials and 1 Uganda Ministry of Finance representative came for the 2nd phase of the &#x201C;Train the Trainers&#x201D; programme: The NL Study-Visit which took place in-house at IBFD, from 27th &#x2013; 31st March 2023. The study-visit consisted of knowledge sharing activities and visits mainly with IBFD but also with collaborative partners. This project was done under the IBFD-BUZA URAPROG Capacity Building programme</narrative>
  </description>
